---
import { SITE, CATEGORIES, CATEGORY_ORDER } from '@lib/site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="container-x py-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-brand-600 text-white text-xs">H</span>
        <span>{SITE.name}</span>
        {SITE.brandEn && <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal ml-1">{SITE.brandEn}</span>}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-md">{SITE.description}</p>
      {SITE.twitter && (
        <a
          href={`https://x.com/${SITE.twitter.replace(/^@/, '')}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-brand-700"
          aria-label={`${SITE.name} X(Twitter)`}
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
            <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
          </svg>
          {SITE.twitter}
        </a>
      )}
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">카테고리</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
        {CATEGORY_ORDER.map((slug) => (
          <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href={`/category/${slug}/`}>{CATEGORIES[slug].name}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">사이트</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/about/">소개</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/editorial-process/">콘텐츠 정리 방식</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/author/healthpick-team/">편집부·편집 원칙</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/tip/">주제 제안</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/contact/">문의</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/privacy/">개인정보처리방침</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/disclaimer/">면책조항</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/sitemap-index.xml">사이트맵</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-brand-700" href="/llms-full.txt">AI 친화 요약 (llms-full.txt)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="container-x py-5 text-xs text-slate-500 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
        <p>© {year} {SITE.name}. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">운영: {SITE.author} · 문의: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`} class="hover:text-brand-700">{SITE.contactEmail}</a></p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-md md:text-right">본 사이트의 콘텐츠는 공개 자료를 바탕으로 한 일반 정보입니다. 의료·법률·금융 등 전문 판단이 필요한 경우 반드시 전문가와 상담하십시오.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
